sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: ACP Delegate Payment: allowance scoping and enforcement
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: ACP Delegate Payment: allowance scoping and enforcement. 4 participants: Agent (AI surface), PSP or vault, Merchant API, and Merchant PSP. 5 steps, 3 crossing a trust boundary, 7 failure branches. Based on openai-acp 2026-04-17 (2026-04-17). Step 1: Agent (AI surface) to PSP or vault: POST /agentic_commerce/delegate_payment. This step crosses a trust boundary. If Same key, different body: 422 idempotency_conflict. If Same key still running: 409 idempotency_in_flight. If No key: 400 idempotency_key_required. Step 2: PSP or vault to PSP or vault: Store card, bind allowance. Step 3: PSP or vault to Agent (AI surface): 201 id: vt_.... Step 4: Agent (AI surface) to Merchant API: Complete with the token. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 5: Merchant API to Merchant PSP: Charge up to the allowance. This step crosses a trust boundary. If Amount above max_amount: Declined by the PSP no ACP error code. If After expires_at: Declined by the PSP no ACP error code. If Different merchant_id or session: Declined by the PSP no ACP error code. If Second use of a one_time token: Declined by the PSP no ACP error code.
  autonumber
  participant p_agent as Agent (AI surface)
  participant p_psp as PSP or vault
  participant p_merchant as Merchant API
  participant p_mpsp as Merchant PSP
  alt Expected path
    p_agent->>p_psp: POST /agentic_commerce/delegate_payment
    Note over p_agent,p_psp: Crosses a trust boundary
  else Same key, different body
    Note over p_agent,p_psp: 422 idempotency_conflict
  else Same key still running
    Note over p_agent,p_psp: 409 idempotency_in_flight
  else No key
    Note over p_agent,p_psp: 400 idempotency_key_required
  end
  p_psp->>p_psp: Store card, bind allowance
  p_psp-->>p_agent: 201 #123; id: vt_... #125;
  p_agent->>p_merchant: Complete with the token
  Note over p_agent,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_merchant->>p_mpsp: Charge up to the allowance
    Note over p_merchant,p_mpsp: Crosses a trust boundary
  else Amount above max_amount
    Note over p_merchant,p_mpsp: Declined by the PSP#59; no ACP error code
  else After expires_at
    Note over p_merchant,p_mpsp: Declined by the PSP#59; no ACP error code
  else Different merchant_id or session
    Note over p_merchant,p_mpsp: Declined by the PSP#59; no ACP error code
  else Second use of a one_time token
    Note over p_merchant,p_mpsp: Declined by the PSP#59; no ACP error code
  end
